        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: અપહરણ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અપહરણ — apaharaṇ — \"a kidnapping\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગઈકાલે એક વેપારીના દીકરાનું અપહરણ થયું. gaīkāle ek vepārīnā dīkrānũ apaharaṇ thayũ. Yesterday a merchant's son was kidnapped."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અપહરણ (apaharaṇ) is a tatsama, Sanskrit apaharaṇa, \"a carrying away, stealing\" (Monier-Williams). In Gujarati it is the carrying off of a person: દીકરાનું અપહરણ થયું."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
