          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગુમ — gum — \"missing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "છોકરો ત્રણ દિવસથી ગુમ હતો. chokro traṇ divasthī gum hato. The boy had been missing for three days."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગુમ (gum) is usually traced to Persian gum, \"lost\". It describes a person or a thing nobody can find: છોકરો ગુમ છે; ગુમ થયો, went missing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
