          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "છોડાવવું (choḍāvvũ) is the causative of છોડવું, to let go, which CDIAL sets under Sanskrit kṣōṭayati (CDIAL 3747): to make someone be let go, and so to get a captive freed."
